  "goodToKnow": "Der Nahverkehr is local and regional public transport: buses, trams, U-Bahn, S-Bahn and regional trains, officially called ÖPNV (öffentlicher Personennahverkehr). Long-distance trains like the ICE and IC are der Fernverkehr. Since May 2023, the Deutschlandticket has allowed unlimited travel on all Nahverkehr across Germany for a monthly fee, a big success that has made regional trains much fuller. It has no plural."
